            <ArticleTitle>Rare behavior of follicular variant of papillary thyroid cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1789-1792</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccr3.1177</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Follicular variant of papillary thyroid cancer typically favors nodal spread. We report a case with hematogenous spread including multi-organ involvement and describe our staged management approach. This is the first case to report follicular variant of papillary thyroid cancer with simultaneous adrenal and renal involvement.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
